        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{16}{25}$",
          "worked": "The two breakfast categories are mutually exclusive.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{only toast or only cereal})&=\\frac{500+300+120+320+320+360}{3000}\\\\P(\\text{only toast or only cereal})&=\\frac{1920}{3000}\\\\P(\\text{only toast or only cereal})&=\\frac{16}{25}\\end{align*}$$",
